{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2018-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1520553600, "end_date": 1521158399, "month_true_total": 212, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:50:43 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "40826002", "author": {"steamid": "76561198352899807", "personaname": "⎛⎝.⎛⓿⏝⏝⓿⎞.⎠", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198352899807/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2711, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1237, "last_played": 1778507819, "avatar": "205d40ba481ef4a69ef0bad0706507d4abc07612"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "这游戏是本地存档，不是云存档，我的存档全没了，所有的角色都变成了一级，啥都没了", "timestamp_created": 1521109949, "timestamp_updated": 1521109949, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.513141334056854248", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "40821883", "author": {"steamid": "76561198204088524", "personaname": "miao", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198204088524/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 11183, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2328, "last_played": 1765719585, "avatar": "3f5e9daea59216d7fe13df4e031d3537580e5e21"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "想了想还是给差评了，目前不推荐入手这个游戏，游戏还在测试而且还是最近才开始测试，这意味着游戏内容非常非常少BUG也是非常多，同样游戏内容少导致玩家很容易乏味，现在的服务器没人了，对，字面上的没人！不是比喻真的没人了。\n1.玩久了非常容易乏味，游戏单一挖矿挖矿和挖矿，需要跟多的模式支持和地图。\n2.职业太单一了，没有多样性。本以为和大部分射击类游戏一样同种职业可以更换枪械什么的，结果大为失望。需要更多的职业和枪械更为自由搭配。\n3.难度弱，现在的难度取决队友的配合，有麦基本可以解决。说白了就是只要你挖矿效率了最高难度都是弱。\n总结就是一个没有剧情没内容全靠刷刷的游戏，没有足够的目标反馈，怎么会有粘性让玩家长入游戏。\n不过游戏非常有潜力推荐关注和愿望单，等完善了可以再考虑入手。   2018.3.15", "timestamp_created": 1521086144, "timestamp_updated": 1521086144, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 30, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.691027641296386719", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "40804881", "author": {"steamid": "76561198152971061", "personaname": "永恒的琥珀", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Mynewsky/", "num_games_owned": 155, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 3255, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2003, "last_played": 1561818199, "avatar": "bf251b42d11a028fdf466fa98fe369a2a29b50fd"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "还不错，一个四人合作刷刷刷的游戏，游戏也相应提供4种职业，每次下矿可以带回两种特殊矿物，每个任务大约会生成两位数的特殊矿物，以及任务本身需要的标的物，取得足够的标的物可以得到钱和经验的奖励，每种职业的武器、护甲、消耗品都需要消耗数百单位的某种特殊矿物，职业外观则每件单独需要数百矿物，相比之下钱基本不会缺，因为每次完成任务都可以得到几千块钱，而升级和外观也无非需要万把来块，需要刷刷刷的东西就这些，任务的变化本身实际上比较小，怪物只有一个主要的系列——虫子，地图的模样和环境特效虽然有好几种，稍微玩一玩也能玩个遍，喜欢匹配几个老哥闲来刷两把，或者有基友一起玩的可以考虑买一个，考虑到现在还在抢先体验，也许以后会更新别的花样吧\n\nPS：基地墙壁上升降的黄柱子可以带你到基地的上层区域缅怀那些喜欢用长方形作为自己名字的先烈", "timestamp_created": 1521018657, "timestamp_updated": 1521018657, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "40801780", "author": {"steamid": "76561198370244746", "personaname": "Goo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/steamoftjy/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 2585, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1187, "last_played": 1670086090, "avatar": "8879826cb45b7dba9d860a07b31ab3292f66a23d"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "啥时候买的，忘了", "timestamp_created": 1521001850, "timestamp_updated": 1608019552